<h2>RCA Video Coin Arcade Game Console</h2>
<p><B>chase.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Chase game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li>
<li>Space (after C): one player game</li>
<li>Tab (after C): two player game</li>
<li>Up &amp; W: Up</li>
<li>Left &amp; A: laft</li>
<li>Right &amp; S: right</li>
<li>Down &amp; Z: down</li>
</ul>
<p><B>en_garde.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the En Garde !! game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li>
<li>Up &amp; W: sword up</li>
<li>Left &amp; S: back</li>
<li>Right &amp; A: attack</li>
<li>Down &amp; Z: sword down</li>
<li>Space &amp; TaB: player shape</li>
</ul>
<p><B>fighter_viii.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Fighter VII game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li> <li>Space (after C): one player game</li> <li>Tab (after C): two player game</li> <li>Up &amp; W: Up</li> <li>Left &amp; A: laft</li> <li>Right &amp; S: right</li> <li>Down &amp; Z: down</li> <li>Space &amp; TaB: drop mine</li>
</ul>
<p><B>kaleidoscope.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Kaleidoscope 'game'. 
</p>
<p>
<p><B>mines1.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Mines 1 game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>Up &amp; W: Fire</li> <li>Left &amp; A: rotate left</li> <li>Right &amp; S: rotate right</li> <li>Down &amp; Z: change direction</li> <li>Space &amp; TaB: drop mines</li>
</ul>
<p><B>mines2.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Mines 2 game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li> <li>Space (after C): one player game</li> <li>Tab (after C): two player game</li> <li>Up &amp; W: Up</li> <li>Left &amp; A: laft</li> <li>Right &amp; S: right</li> <li>Down &amp; Z: down</li> <li>Space &amp; TaB: drop mine</li>
</ul>
<p><B>scramble-split_second.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Scramble and Split-second games. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li> <li>Right (after C): Scramble</li> <li>A (after C): Split-second</li> <li>Up &amp; W: Up</li> <li>Left &amp; A: left</li> <li>Right &amp; S: right</li> <li>Down &amp; Z: down</li> <li>Space &amp; TaB: fire</li>
</ul>
<p><B>swords.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Swords game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li> <li>Space (after C): one player game</li> <li>Tab (after C): two player game</li> <li>Up &amp; W: Up</li> <li>Left &amp; S: back or player shape</li> <li>Right &amp; A: attack</li> <li>Down &amp; Z: down</li> <li>Space &amp; TaB: sword up/down</li>
</ul>
<p><B>touche.xml</B></p>
<p>
Coin Arcade running the Touche !! game. 
</p>
<p>
Key definition:
</p>
<ul>
<li>C: coin / start</li> <li>Up &amp; W: Up</li> <li>Left &amp; S: back or player shape</li> <li>Right &amp; A: attack</li> <li>Down &amp; Z: down</li> <li>Space &amp; TaB: sword up/down</li>
</ul>

